      resources/template.html; the semantic class names and CSS custom
      property names follow upstream 1's template.
  - themes/classic/theme.css: dark values from upstream 2's palette,
      light values from upstream 1's classic light palette, with the
      same --arrow contrast fix as above.
  - skills/creating-diagrams/references/diagram-types.md and
